			]
			description: [
				"&7The Forge Rocket Door is constructed using a collection of stone and building materials obtained from the many dimensions and planets visited throughout your adventure.&r"
				""
				"Unlike components focused on mass production, this recipe emphasizes exploration and progression, requiring resources gathered from across the entire pack."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Before beginning construction, ensure you have collected materials from:"
				""
				"- The Overworld"
				"- The Nether"
				"- The Otherside"
				"- The End"
				"- Ad Astra planets"
				"- Post-End worlds"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Every block used in its construction tells the story of a world you conquered and a challenge you overcame."
				""
				"Review the recipe carefully and begin gathering the materials needed to complete this important piece of the Forge Rocket."
			]
